From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:47:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] greeter: answer informational and error auth messages

greetd's PAM conversation blocks on every auth_message, including the
"info" and "error" kinds, so a greeter that only displayed them without
replying left the session showing "Authenticating..." forever. Reply to
those messages with a null response, as the reference client does.

Assisted-by: opencode:deepseek-flash
AI-Scope: generated the null post_auth_message_response for info and error auth messages in greeter_main.c
---
 src/greeter_main.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/greeter_main.c b/src/greeter_main.c
index b5a8c26..c8c8abc 100644
--- a/src/greeter_main.c
+++ b/src/greeter_main.c
@@ -622,6 +622,12 @@ static void greetd_handle(void) {
                         ? json_object_get_string_member(root, "auth_message") : "";
                     snprintf(status_text, sizeof status_text, "%s", m);
                     status_error = (g_strcmp0(amt, "error") == 0);
+                    /* greetd's PAM conversation blocks until every auth_message
+                     * is answered, including informational and error messages
+                     * (its conv.info/conv.error wait for a response). Not
+                     * answering wedges the session with "Authenticating..."
+                     * showing forever. Reply with a null response. */
+                    greetd_post_response(NULL);
                     render_all();
                 } else {
                     const char *m = json_object_has_member(root, "auth_message")
